                | Enrolled at the University of Adelaide (Now known as Adelaide
                | University) to pursue a Bachelor&rsquo;s degree in Computer Science,
                | with a major in Artifical Intelligence.
              p(style='color: grey; padding: 0px')
                | (Part-time studies)
            .timeline-item.right(data-date='October 2026-Present')
              a(href="https://www.fleetspace.com/" target="_blank")
                img#fleet.company-logo(src='img/companies/fleet.png' alt='Fleet Logo' style="height: 20px;")
              h3(style='margin-top: 0.3rem')
                | Junior IT Support Specialist
